{"schema":3,"schemaVersion":3,"buildId":"v212-20dbabd4241ad0","words":{"which":{"word":"which","nativeZh":["pron. 哪一个, 那一个"],"senses":[{"id":"ecdict:which:64bb3b0298eb7af9af","pos":"adj","en":"Of what sort or kind; what; what a; who.","zh":"什么样的,什么的,什么的,一个的,谁的。","translation":"machine","domainZh":"词典补充","domainEn":"Additional dictionary sense","source":"ECDICT","sourceRefs":[{"source":"ECDICT","version":"local-frozen-20261026","sourceTextHash":"a24b42d1c1a0995e89c523372afc16bc577b1d501322eefa4f6010c0f8dd437a"}],"pairId":"41e2008d78d73d8a3ae66f14","reviewStatus":"machine_screened","qualityIssues":[]},{"id":"ecdict:which:86703f1158350145b5","pos":"adj","en":"A interrogative pronoun, used both substantively and adjectively, and in direct and indirect questions, to ask for, or refer to, an individual person or thing among several of a class; as, which man is it? which woman was it? which is the house? he asked which route he should take; which is best, to live or to die? See the Note under What, pron., 1.","zh":"审讯代词,既用实质性的又用形容性的,又用直接的和间接的问题,来要求,或指个人或某类中若干类的事情;如,是哪个男人?是哪个女人?是哪个房子?他问他应该走哪条路线;是哪条最好,是活还是死?见\"什么\"下的注,pron, 1.","translation":"machine","domainZh":"词典补充","domainEn":"Additional dictionary sense","source":"ECDICT","sourceRefs":[{"source":"ECDICT","version":"local-frozen-20261026","sourceTextHash":"987f5a54241e743c9d23023a2d062f006e7e725c40c7074dbf3fd9f14958065f"}],"pairId":"7cf0a98e1b804f06b8b3c44f","reviewStatus":"machine_screened","qualityIssues":[]},{"id":"ecdict:which:b2e4558e77531e340f","pos":"pron","en":"A relative pronoun, used esp. in referring to an antecedent noun or clause, but sometimes with reference to what is specified or implied in a sentence, or to a following noun or clause (generally involving a reference, however, to something which has preceded). It is used in all numbers and genders, and was formerly used of persons.","zh":"相对代词,在指前名词或条款时使用esp.,但有时指句子中具体或暗示的内容,或后面的名词或条款(但一般指以前的东西),在所有数字和性别中都使用,以前曾用于人.","translation":"machine","domainZh":"词典补充","domainEn":"Additional dictionary sense","source":"ECDICT","sourceRefs":[{"source":"ECDICT","version":"local-frozen-20261026","sourceTextHash":"380b611f3fddd3865947ed4887c938b1b2ef07789e4fa9d55bf253dc729844c9"}],"pairId":"9b829521be3cec7b9cb07832","reviewStatus":"machine_screened","qualityIssues":[]},{"id":"ecdict:which:d4947ed99602ea6100","pos":"pron","en":"A compound relative or indefinite pronoun, standing for any one which, whichever, that which, those which, the . . . which, and the like; as, take which you will.","zh":"复合关系代词或不定代词，可表示任何一个、无论哪一个、那个或那些等；例如take which you will表示选你愿意选的那个。","translation":"edited","domainZh":"词典补充","domainEn":"Additional dictionary sense","source":"ECDICT","sourceRefs":[{"source":"ECDICT","version":"local-frozen-20261026","sourceTextHash":"f9c8206560da82dc32f7ba13a80ed1ef36785d7f60272738919e90d11e1bb662"}],"pairId":"fd0d9ded8890190b7252f358","reviewStatus":"editorial","qualityIssues":[]}],"phrases":[{"en":"every which way","zh":"随机方式","definition":"in a random manner","pos":"r","kind":"词典收录表达","sourcePhraseSynsetId":"00070765-r","sourcePhraseVersion":"WordNet-3.0","translation":"machine","definitionZh":"随机方式","definitionTranslation":"machine","sourcePhraseSenseIds":["wn30:00070765-r"],"senseScope":"phrase","senseId":"wn30:every_which_way%4:02:01::","senseIds":["wn30:every_which_way%4:02:01::"],"alignmentStatus":"aligned","phraseSense":{"id":"wn30:every_which_way%4:02:01::","lemma":"every which way","pos":"r","definitionEn":"in a random manner","source":"WordNet","version":"3.0","synsetId":"00070765-r","senseKey":"every_which_way%4:02:01::"},"id":"phrase:which:274ce5c27a57ddf094","pairId":"f74a829c79e8fc2878da6723","reviewStatus":"machine_screened","qualityIssues":[],"definitionPair":{"en":"in a random manner","zh":"随机方式","translation":"machine","pairId":"66acc673cf5eb0ae3b46bd59","reviewStatus":"machine_screened","qualityIssues":[]},"originalChineseSourceGloss":{"text":"四面八方, 非常混乱地","source":"ECDICT","alignmentStatus":"word_level